          "",
          "These words create a subordinate clause.",
          "The verb goes to the END of that clause.",
          "",
          "bevor (before)",
          "nachdem (after)",
          "während (while)",
          "sobald (as soon as)",
          "bis (until)",
          "",
          "EXAMPLE:",
